msgid "application.properties support"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We are very pleased to announce the 1.0.0 release of Quarkus Tools for IntelliJ.\n"
"This release brings enhanced code completion and syntax validation for `application.properties`\n"
"and better support for Microprofile in Java files. It is not based anymore on the LSP Support plugin in order to increase stability."
msgstr ""

msgid "In order to install it, search for `Quarkus Tools` in the JetBrains marketplace or download from https://plugins.jetbrains.com/plugin/13234-quarkus-tools[here]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Here is an overview of the major features:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Code completion (Ctrl + ENTER)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Property documentation"
msgstr ""

msgid "Select a property and press Ctrl+Q"
msgstr ""

msgid "Goto property definition"
msgstr ""

msgid "Select a property and press Ctrl+B"
msgstr ""

msgid "Syntax validation"
msgstr ""

msgid "Wrong property key names or values are reported"
msgstr ""

msgid "Property hover in Java files"
msgstr ""

msgid "Property managed in your code through @ConfigProperty:"
msgstr ""

msgid "code completion in application.properties is adjusted accordingly if you define new properties"
msgstr ""

msgid "hover over the property field will display the current value"
msgstr ""

msgid "MicroProfile Health"
msgstr ""

msgid "Syntax validation is being performed for Java files using the MicroProfile Health assets:"
msgstr ""

msgid "MicroProfile Fault Tolerance"
msgstr "MicroProfile Fault Tolerance"

msgid ""
"MicroProfile Health related properties are supported in `application.properties` completion\n"
"and syntax validation as soon as you use MicroProfile related annotation in your Java\n"
"source files"
msgstr ""

msgid "MicroProfile Rest Client"
msgstr ""

msgid "MicroProfile Rest Client references are checked against valid injections"
msgstr ""

msgid "MicroProfile LRA"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"MicroProfile LRA related properties references are supported in `application.properties` completion\n"
"and syntax validation as soon as you use MicroProfile LRA in your Quarkus application"
msgstr ""

msgid "MicroProfile OpenAPI"
msgstr "MicroProfile OpenAPI"

msgid ""
"MicroProfile OpenAPI related properties references are supported in `application.properties` completion\n"
"and syntax validation as soon as you use MicroProfile OpenAPI in your Quarkus application"
msgstr ""

msgid "MicroProfile Metrics"
msgstr "MicroProfile Metrics"

msgid ""
"MicroProfile Metrics related properties references are supported in `application.properties` completion\n"
"and syntax validation as soon as you use MicroProfile Metrics in your Quarkus application"
msgstr ""

msgid "MicroProfile OpenTracing"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"MicroProfile OpenTracing related properties references are supported in `application.properties` completion\n"
"and syntax validation as soon as you use MicroProfile OpenTracing in your Quarkus application"
msgstr ""

msgid "Moving Forward"
msgstr "将来"

msgid ""
"If you have any questions,\n"
"suggestions or feedback, by all means please https://github.com/redhat-developer/intellij-quarkus/issues[open an issue]."
msgstr "ご質問、ご意見、ご感想などがありましたら、ぜひ link:https://github.com/redhat-developer/intellij-quarkus/issues[イシューを開いて]ください。"

msgid "For future releases we are aiming to improve language support for YAML properties file."
msgstr ""

